<title>HUNGARY: CESI index dips, ends at 1,430.41 pts.</title>
<headline>CESI index dips, ends at 1,430.41 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index eased 1.69 points or 0.12 percent to 1,430.41 points on Tuesday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungarian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
